From 2a8ec5b411762426d0c54665a192839c491a8932 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:59:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: qcs6490-imdt-sbc: Keep L18B on

L18B feeds the carrier's +VREG_L15B_1P8, which powers the DSI backlight
enable buffer. Nothing on the SoM claims it, so the regulator core turns
it off after boot. Keep it always on.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc.dts | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc.dts
index b8504cc6bcab..df5ca90a188d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc.dts
@@ -957,3 +957,8 @@ &usb_2_hsphy {
 &usb_dp_qmpphy_out {
 	remote-endpoint = <&cypd6125_ss_in>;
 };
+
+/* Feeds the carrier +VREG_L15B_1P8, which powers the backlight buffer */
+&vreg_l18b_1p8 {
+	regulator-always-on;
+};
